                        <i class="fas fa-quote-left text-muted me-2"></i>
                        Through their skills acquisition program, I was able to start my own business. The support system and network provided has been invaluable to my success.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Donation & Sponsorship Section -->
<section id="donation-section" class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-4" style="color: #667eea;">DONATION AND SPONSORSHIP</h2>
        
